# gr-L1-impact-assessment-quality-gate — LLM-Driven Colang Implementation
# Layer: L1 — fires at L1-planning-impact-assessor-evaluator's post_execution
# Validates L1-planning-impact-assessor's RESULTANT output (not the evaluator's own bookkeeping)
# Python actions preserved in actions.py for reference/hybrid mode

define flow check output impact assessment quality gate
  """LLM validates L1-planning-impact-assessor's resultant output against its own schema and evaluation.md rubric."""
  $result = execute self_check_output

  if not $result
    bot block impact assessment quality gate violation
    stop

define bot block impact assessment quality gate violation
  "L1-planning-impact-assessor's resultant output (post-evaluation) failed its quality gate: schema violation, an invalid blast_radius, a vacuous capability check, an unchecked existing_system_impact, an invented/missing CI or FR reference, or an FR left without a component. The workflow cannot proceed to dependency-mapper/backlog-prioritizer with non-conformant impact-assessment content. Retrying."
